      "title_at_amendment": "Landing lights.",
      "text": "(a) Each installed landing light must be acceptable. (b) Each landing light must be installed so that-- (1) No dangerous glare is visible to the pilot; (2) The pilot is not seriously affected by halation; and (3) It provides enough light for night landing.",
