      "subpart_at_time": "Equipment",
      "title_at_amendment": "Taxi and landing lights.",
      "text": "[Each taxi and landing light must be designed and installed so that: (a) No dangerous glare is visible to the pilots. (b) The pilot is not seriously affected by halation. (c) It provides enough light for night operations. (d) It does not cause a fire hazard in any configuration.]",
